<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FelCor Suite upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FelCor Suite upped to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber has raised its rating for FelCor Suite Hotels Inc to buy from attractive, a source at the brokerage said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Irving, Texas, hotel chain closed on Monday at 35-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
